\", v.show()),\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nimpl<A: BitEq, B: BitEq, C: BitEq, D: BitEq, E: BitEq> BitEq for (A, B, C, D, E) {\n    fn bit_eq(&self, o: &Self) -> bool {\n        self.0.bit_eq(&o.0)\n            && self.1.bit_eq(&o.1)\n            && self.2.bit_eq(&o.2)\n            && self.3.bit_eq(&o.3)\n            && self.4.bit_eq(&o.4)\n    }\n    fn show(&self) -> String {\n        format!(\n            \"({}, {}, {}, {}, {})\",\n            self.0.show(),\n            self.1.show(),\n            self.2.show(),\n            self.3.show(),\n            self.4.show()\n        )\n    }\n}\n\nimpl BitEq for c2Poly {"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1930,"cache_read_input_tokens":125605,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1930,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4bcc327f-132f-463a-99a7-0691637f7d66","uuid":"5c610e0f-9d8e-4646-a016-ccd41ca60c5f","timestamp":"2026-08-27T12:46:22.535Z"}
